WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:15.137
In 2022, during parliamentary committee testimony, it was disclosed that an employee at Veterans Affairs Canada had offered Medical Assistance in Dying to military veterans who were seeking structural support, such as accessibility ramps.

00:00:15.137 --> 00:00:20.962
Formal investigations confirmed these occurrences across multiple veteran case files.
